  "intro": {
    "language": "en",
    "text": "Bonnie Chan Yi-ting (Chinese: 陳翊庭; Cantonese Yale: Chàhn Yihk Tìhng; born 1970) is a Hong Kong business executive. As of April 2026, she is the chief executive officer (CEO) of Hong Kong Exchange and Clearing (HKEX) since 1 March 2024.\nIn 2025, Chan ranked 63rd in the Forbes list of World's 100 Most Powerful Women. Time magazine named her on the Time 100 list of the world's most influential people in 2025.\n\n",
    "sourceId": "wikipedia-en",
    "usage": "Research excerpt; paraphrase and cross-check before publication."
  },
